      "TabDescription": "Choose how each rating marks an item, so Bad, Not Ideal, and Good items stand out at a glance.<br><br>Glow, Badge, and Dot use the rating's Color: Glow is a band fading in from the slot's edge, Badge is a small icon on a dark background in one corner, and Dot is a small dot in the opposite corner. Dim darkens the item, and Gray drains most of its color, rarity border included. On equipped items, Bad and Not Ideal show only the badge, and Good shows nothing.",
